<title>USA: Merchants Group to buy back additional shrs.</title>
<headline>Merchants Group to buy back additional shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchants Group Inc said Monday its board of directors had approved the repurchase of up to 100,000 additional shares of its common stock.  </p>
<p>The company said the amount represented about three percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>It said it bought back 225,000 shares since it first announced its repurchase program in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Through its wholly-owned subsidiary, Merchants Insurance Co of New Hampshire Inc, the company offers property and casualty insurance.</p>
</text>
